            "spaceBefore": 0,
            "spaceAfter": 2,
            "lineHeight": 1.4,
            "indent": 0,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Approximately 264 penguins.",
                "marks": []
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "p19-q8-short-method",
            "type": "paragraph",
            "fontSize": null,
            "align": "left",
            "spaceBefore": 0,
            "spaceAfter": 2,
            "lineHeight": 1.4,
            "indent": 0,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Use the sample's tagged proportion to estimate the whole colony.",
                "marks": []
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "worked": "Assume the tagged proportion in the second catch represents the tagged proportion in the colony.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}\\text{Tagged fraction in the sample}&=\\frac{5}{33}\\\\\\text{Scale factor from sample to colony}&=40\\div5=8\\\\\\text{Estimated colony size}&=33\\times8=264\\end{align*}$$\n\nThe colony contains approximately 264 penguins.",
